sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Operator / Engineer
    participant Web as Web Control UI (Vite)
    participant Cognito as Cognito User Pool
    participant STS as Cognito Identity Pool & STS
    participant Gateway as Bedrock AgentCore Secure Gateway

    User->>Web: Enter Email & Password
    Web->>Cognito: Request Authentication (SRP Flow)
    Cognito-->>Web: Return ID Token & Access Token

    Web->>STS: Present ID Token (GetCredentialsForIdentity)
    STS-->>Web: Return Temp AWS Credentials (AccessKey, SecretKey, SessionToken)

    User->>Web: Click "Trigger Robot Wave"
    Note over Web, Gateway: Web client signs HTTP request using AWS Signature Version 4 (SigV4)
    Web->>Gateway: POST /mcp (SigV4 Signed Payload)
    Note over Gateway: Gateway verifies signature validity and IAM policy bounds
    Gateway-->>Web: Access Authorized, Execute Action, Return Response
